<dl>
<dt>Source:
<dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
<dt>Sent when:
<dd>An object tries to initiate dialog with the object receiving the event, either by clicking or by scripting
<dt>Sent from:
<dd>engine (clicking on object to talk) or scripts (manually sending this event)
<dt>Sent to:
<dd>creatures, placeables
<dt>Parameters:
<dd>
<ul>
<li>Creator: Initiating object</li><li>String 0: Dialog to initiate, "" to use default object dialog</li>
</ul>
</dl>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h3>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><span style="color: #0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Case%20keyword" title="Case keyword (page does not exist)">case</a></span> EVENT_TYPE_DIALOGUE:<br />{<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oInitiator = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventCreator" title="GetEventCreator">GetEventCreator</a>(ev); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// Initiating object</span><br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/String%20keyword" title="String keyword">string</a> sDialog = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventString" title="GetEventString">GetEventString</a>(ev, <span style="color: #7F007F;">0</span>); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// Dialog to initiate, "" to use default object dialog</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#007F00; font-style:italic;">// insert event-handling code here</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Break%20keyword" title="Break keyword (page does not exist)">break</a></span>;<br />}</div>
